From ideal gas law, moles of CH₄ per day at 298 K and 101.325 kPa:

\[
n = \frac{PV}{RT}
= \frac{(101325\ \text{Pa})(2.2\times10^5\ \text{m}^3)}
{(8.314)(298)}
= 8.997\times10^6\ \text{mol day}^{-1}
\]

Using \(\Delta_r H_{2000} = -781.9\ \text{kJ mol}^{-1}\) from 4.7:

\[
E = n \times |\Delta_r H|
= (8.997\times10^6)(781.9\times10^3)
= 7.04\times10^{12}\ \text{J day}^{-1}
\]

FINAL ANSWER: \(7.04\times10^{12}\ \text{J day}^{-1}\) released.

Using \(\Delta E = 185.2\ \text{MeV}\) from 4.4:

\[
E_{\text{total}} = 30 \times 1000 \times 4.184\times 10^9
= 1.2552\times 10^{14}\ \text{J}
\]

\[
\Delta E = 185.2\ \text{MeV}
= 185.2 \times 1.602\times 10^{-13}\ \text{J}
= 2.967\times 10^{-11}\ \text{J}
\]

\[
N_{\text{fissions}} = \frac{1.2552\times 10^{14}}{2.967\times 10^{-11}}
= 4.23\times 10^{24}
\]

Mass of \(^{235}\text{U}\) that fissioned:

\[
m_{235,\text{fiss}} =
\frac{4.23\times 10^{24}}{6.022\times10^{23}}
\times 235.04\ \text{g}
= 1.65\ \text{kg}
\]

Only 33% of the total \(^{235}\text{U}\) fissioned, and the uranium is 90% \(^{235}\text{U}\):

\[
m = \frac{1.65}{0.33 \times 0.90}
= 5.56\ \text{kg}
\]

FINAL ANSWER: \(N_{\text{fissions}} = 4.23\times10^{24}\), \(m = 5.56\ \text{kg}\) enriched uranium.

Using the flow scheme, the net stoichiometry per 4 mol \(N_2\) from air is:

\[
3.5\,CH_4 + 5\,H_2O + O_2 + 4N_2 \rightarrow 8NH_3 + 3.5CO_2
\]

So the theoretical methane requirement is:

\[
m(CH_4)_{\text{theor}} 
= 660{,}000\ \text{t NH}_3 \times \frac{3.5 \times 16}{8 \times 17}
= 271{,}765\ \text{t}
\]

At 97% overall yield:

\[
m(CH_4)_{\text{required}}
= \frac{271{,}765}{0.97}
= 280{,}170\ \text{t}
\]

FINAL ANSWER: \(2.80 \times 10^5\) metric tons of methane per year.

Species 3 is methyldiethanolamine (MDEA), a tertiary amine. In aqueous CO₂ scrubbing it promotes CO₂ hydrolysis:

\[
\mathrm{HOCH_2CH_2\!-\!N(CH_3)\!-\!CH_2CH_2OH}
+ \mathrm{CO_2} + \mathrm{H_2O}
\rightleftharpoons
\mathrm{HOCH_2CH_2\!-\!\overset{+}{N}H(CH_3)\!-\!CH_2CH_2OH}
+ \mathrm{HCO_3^-}
\]

FINAL ANSWER: \(\mathrm{MDEA + CO_2 + H_2O \rightleftharpoons MDEAH^+ + HCO_3^-}\)
